WEBVTT

00:20:29.708 --> 00:20:31.184
AG: Because I feel like --

00:20:31.208 --> 00:20:33.476
particularly if the person
is asking me for time

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:35.226
or asking for my help or advice,

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:39.018
I feel like they should probably
accommodate my schedule

00:20:39.042 --> 00:20:40.309
and my convenience.

00:20:40.333 --> 00:20:42.393
As opposed to,
"I'm going to impose on you,

00:20:42.417 --> 00:20:44.559
at a time that is most
inconvenient for you."

00:20:44.583 --> 00:20:46.684
EP: Right, "Can you
help me on this moment?"

00:20:46.708 --> 00:20:47.976
AG: Yes.
EP: Yeah.

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:51.018
AG: Ideally today or tomorrow, yeah.

00:20:51.042 --> 00:20:53.351
So I was thinking about something --

00:20:53.375 --> 00:20:55.768
EP: But can I ask you something?
AG: Yeah, please.

00:20:55.792 --> 00:20:57.893
EP: Because if you're
going to define trust,

00:20:57.917 --> 00:21:00.184
I think what's really important
is to talk about